WEBVTT

00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:14,390
How can one naturally eliminate kidney stones?

00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:16,710
Well, you can't always.

00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:21,710
So the general medical way of eliminating kidney stones,

00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:26,310
number one is to wait till they pass

00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:29,710
and to give a person pain medication until they pass.

00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:34,830
You can go in there and surgically remove them.

00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:37,590
You can go in there and use laser removement

00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:39,950
of kidney stones.

00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:45,390
Eurologist typically would do those procedures.

00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:50,230
From a natural perspective, we have a herbal product

00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:55,230
that is called stoned something,

00:00:55,630 --> 00:00:56,990
something for kidney stones.

00:00:56,990 --> 00:01:01,510
I'd like to look up the name of that product.

00:01:03,550 --> 00:01:06,390
It's, let's see what it is.

00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:10,470
It's called stoned breaker.

00:01:10,470 --> 00:01:14,910
It's a product from herb farm

00:01:14,910 --> 00:01:17,550
and it has some different herbs in there

00:01:17,550 --> 00:01:20,510
that have been helpful for kidney stones.

00:01:20,510 --> 00:01:23,150
Have we used that successfully?

00:01:23,150 --> 00:01:24,350
I don't know.

00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:29,030
I don't, it's not something that we treat on a regular basis

00:01:29,030 --> 00:01:31,630
or talk about on a regular basis.

00:01:31,630 --> 00:01:36,630
So I know I've referred people to use that product

00:01:37,510 --> 00:01:41,870
in the past, but I don't know if that helped them.

00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:44,790
I didn't get a report back quite honestly.

00:01:44,790 --> 00:01:45,630
So.

